<title>HONG KONG: Hong Kong October merchandise trade figures.</title>
<headline>Hong Kong October merchandise trade figures.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1996-12-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Hong Kong's Census and Statistics Department released the following figures for merchandise trade on Thursday:</p>
<p>(Rounded figures in billions of Hong Kong dollars and year-on-year percentage change, with *** denoting less than 0.05 percent)</p>
<p>Re-exports to the five main destinations</p>
<p>					 Oct 1996	   Sept 1996</p>
<p> China				 37.87 (+13.8)    33.07 (- 0.2)</p>
<p> U.S.				  23.48 (+ 4.9)    26.46 (+10.5)</p>
<p> Japan				  7.88 (+12.6)     7.51 (- 1.7)</p>
<p> Germany				4.15 (- 0.5)     4.15 (- 0.3)</p>
<p> U.K.				   3.59 (+ 8.5)     3.86 (+15.6)</p>
<p>Domestic exports to the five main destinations</p>
<p>					   Oct 1996	  Sept 1996</p>
<p> China				  5.90 (+ 7.1)    5.15 (- 9.7)</p>
<p> U.S.				   5.39 (-14.1)    5.14 (-19.8)</p>
<p> Japan				  0.96 (- 4.6)    0.87 (- 7.4)</p>
<p> Germany				0.91 (+ 2.6)    0.87 (- 2.1)</p>
<p> U.K.				   0.90 (- 4.4)    0.96 (- 8.0)</p>
<p>Imports from the five main suppliers</p>
<p>					   Oct 1996	  Sept 1996</p>
<p> China				 53.42 (+ 9.5)    53.12 (+ 1.9)</p>
<p> Japan				 18.57 (- 2.1)    17.33 (- 8.2)</p>
<p> Taiwan				10.73 (-12.6)     9.91 (- 4.9)</p>
<p> U.S.				  11.45 (+12.7)     9.33 (- 3.6)</p>
<p> Singapore			    6.65 (+ 0.9)     6.57 (+ 0.9)</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6441</p>
